1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,250
Helikoptern snurrar … (Snurrar!)

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,850
Upp, upp, upp! (Upp!)

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:11,950
Nu flyger vi!

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,950
Gul-li-gul-li-gul! (Gul-li-gul!)

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,950
Helikopter, helikopter – (snurr, snurr!)

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,250
Upp till solen – (hej, hej!)

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,450
Solen bjuder på en banan – (mums, mums!)

8
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,850
Nu blir du glad! (Så glad!)

9
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:29,950
Gul är den gladaste färgen! (Ha-ha!)
